\caption{Potential locations for the 4th hub in Lahore}
\label{fig:potential_hubs}
\end{figure}

Figure \ref{fig:hub_scale} provides a close-up view of the potential locations for the 4th hub, illustrating the distance between each successive point.


\begin{figure}[htbp]
\centerline{\includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{scale.png}}
\caption{Zoomed-in view of potential 4th hub locations}
\label{fig:hub_scale}
