A random sample of 20,000 deliveries was selected from the cleaned dataset of 57,349 total deliveries to analyze the distribution of deliveries. The sampling process was performed using the Pandas \cite{noauthor_pandas_nodate} library in Python \cite{noauthor_welcome_2024}. Figure \ref{fig:existing_hubs} illustrates the locations of the three existing hubs along with the geospatial data of past deliveries on the map of Lahore.


