    \[
    0 < \sum_{}|\lambda'_i| \le  \sum|\lambda_i|,
    \]
where \((p',\lambda')=(p,\lambda)+(p_0,\lambda_\varepsilon)\).

On the other hand, applying the \textbf{Lemma \ref{main-func-ineq}} gives
