%BeginExpansion
\mathbb{Z}
%EndExpansion
$-module $%
%TCIMACRO{\U{2124} }%
%BeginExpansion
\mathbb{Z}
%EndExpansion
_{6}$ is a pseudo simple module since $%
%TCIMACRO{\U{2124} }%
%BeginExpansion
\mathbb{Z}
%EndExpansion
\overline{2}=%
%TCIMACRO{\U{2124} }%
%BeginExpansion
\mathbb{Z}
%EndExpansion
\overline{4}$ and $%
%TCIMACRO{\U{2124} }%
%BeginExpansion
