Note that for $p \in (0, 1)$, $\VaR_p(H_t) = t - (1-t) \ln(1-p) = t \VaR_p(\delta_1) + (1-t) \VaR_p(E)$. 		Thus, we have
\begin{align*}
	\RVaR_{\alpha, \beta}(F) &\geq \RVaR_{\alpha, \beta}(H_t)
			= t\,\RVaR_{\alpha, \beta}(\delta_1) + (1-t)\,\RVaR_{\alpha, \beta}(E) \\
			&\geq \min \{{\rm RVaR}_{\alpha, \beta}(E), \RVaR_{\alpha, \beta}(\delta_1)\}.
\end{align*}
This completes the proof of the theorem.
