-q_1 & q_1 \\
q_2 & -q_2
\end{pmatrix},$$
where $q_1$ and $q_2$ are positive constants. We begin by fixing $q_1 = q_2 = 0.2$ and $\gamma_1 = 0$. With these parameters set, we will then vary the price impact parameter $\gamma_2$ to analyze its effect on the continuation and exercise regions of the value functions $v_1$ and $v_2$.
