          \item[{\rm (iii)}]
          ${\psi}$ is self-adjoint i.e. for any $x\in   E$    we have        ${\psi}(x^*) ={\psi}(x)^*$.
           \end{itemize}
           \end{dfn}
           \noindent
           Obviously the restriction to $E$ of any $*$-homomorphism from $C$ to $C_1$
