          $$ {\psi}_2{\psi}_1(xy)-{\psi}_2{\psi}_1(x){\psi}_2{\psi}_1(y)=
         [ {\psi}_2({\psi}_1(xy)-{\psi}_1(x){\psi}_1(y)) ]+[{\psi}_2 ({\psi}_1(x){\psi}_1(y)) -{\psi}_2{\psi}_1(x){\psi}_2{\psi}_1(y)].$$
