Thus we have proved the following:

\begin{lem}\label{rch1'} Let $\psi_k: E_{k-1} \to E_k$ be $\vp_k$-morphisms with $\sum \vp_k\le 1$.
The composition ${\psi}_{n}\cdots {\psi}_2{\psi}_1:   E_0 \to E_n$ is an $\vp$-morphism
with $\vp =e^2 \sum\nl_1^n \vp_{k}$.
