Let 
$$Z_n=C_0\oplus \cdots \oplus C_{n-1} \oplus   \{ (x,T_{n+1}(x),T_{n+2}T_{n+1}(x), T_{n+3}T_{n+2}T_{n+1}(x),\cdots)\mid x\in E_n \}   \subset L$$ or equivalently

