You must report the source names in the sources field, if 
possible, the page number, equation number, table number, 
section number, etc.
% \end{Verbatim}
\end{tcolorbox}
These distinct prompts demonstrate different strategies for balancing response quality, source attributions, and output formatting in scientific RAG systems.

